            note: "Read the PDF text: indicator 6.3.1 (household wastewater generated and safely treated, 2024), 6.4.1 Table 2 (sectoral withdrawals 2015 and 2023, km3/year), 6.4.2 (water stress 2023). The table's text extracts with its columns interleaved; the four totals were matched by their sum (2,885.53 + 599.93 + 534.75 = 4,020.21 against the stated 4,022.09) and by the stated percentage changes.",
        ),
        (
            id: "aquastat-water-use",
            title: "AQUASTAT, Water use (methodology and thematic discussion)",
